    <string name="model_tagline_qwen3_0_6b">"Small · fully in memory"</string>
    <string name="model_description_qwen3_0_6b">"Qwen3 0.6B in the official 8-bit build (639 MB). Lightweight; good for trying the app and for short answers."</string>
    <string name="model_tagline_qwen35_9b_q4">"Medium · fully in memory · images"</string>
    <string name="model_description_qwen35_9b_q4">"Qwen3.5 9B, a dense model of the same family as Equity\'s larger models, in Unsloth\'s 4-bit build (5.7 GB). It stays fully in memory, so it needs more free RAM than the streamed models; image input is an optional download."</string>
    <string name="model_tagline_qwen35_9b_iq3">"Medium · fully in memory · less RAM · images"</string>
    <string name="model_description_qwen35_9b_iq3">"The same Qwen3.5 9B in Unsloth\'s dynamic 3-bit build (4.0 GB), for when less memory is free. It stays fully in memory; image input is an optional download. It has not yet been compared with the 4-bit build on Equity\'s quality set."</string>
    <string name="model_tagline_qwen36_35b_iq2m">"Large · twice the phone\'s RAM · experimental"</string>
    <string name="model_description_qwen36_35b_iq2m">"Qwen3.6 35B-A3B, a mixture-of-experts model with 3B parameters active per token, in Unsloth\'s dynamic 2.7-bit build (11.9 GB). The shared weights stay in memory and the experts are read from storage as each token needs them. On Equity\'s quality set it scored like the 4-bit build."</string>
    <string name="model_tagline_qwen36_35b_q4km">"Large · twice the phone\'s RAM · quality reference · experimental"</string>
    <string name="model_description_qwen36_35b_q4km">"The same Qwen3.6 35B-A3B in Unsloth\'s dynamic 4-bit build (22.7 GB), Equity\'s quality reference. The shared weights stay in memory and the experts are read from storage as each token needs them."</string>
    <string name="model_tagline_qwen38_flash_next">"Huge · seven times the phone\'s RAM · experimental"</string>
    <string name="model_description_qwen38_flash_next">"Qwen3.8 Flash Next: a 125B mixture-of-experts model (512 experts, 10 per token) with a 51B n-gram memory, in Unsloth\'s dynamic UD-Q2_K_XL build (78.9 GB). Only about 3.4 GB stays in memory; experts and n-gram rows are read from storage as each token needs them. Needs about 80 GB of free storage."</string>
